}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le15ob10re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le15ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le15ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le15ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Have you ever experienced the excitement of a live performance? How breathtaking is it to feel the emotions of a jazz solo? Where else would you rather be?"}, {"time": "8500", "image": "engenn6le15ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "I took the day to walk around the festival. First, I watched some of the free shows. There were probably two million people on the streets.   I heard a mixture of sounds, from experimental jazz to conventional blues music. The cafes were filled with activity. People were dancing happily in the streets. Then I continued along to Parc Musical, where joyful children were running around.\nHow idyllic was that moment?In a few months Montreal will once again become a cold, snowy winter city. I would rather enjoy the summer while it lasts! I would rather celebrate music and life in unison with an entire city!"}, {"time": "46000", "image": "engenn6le15ob10re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "If you are a jazz lover like me, you owe it to yourself to visit the Festival at least once in your life. I'd rather warn you though: you might want to come back every year after that!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}